---
// HowItWorks.astro — 3-step progressive evaluation workflow
---

<div class="my-10 space-y-4">
  <!-- Step 1 -->
  <div class="walkthrough-step">
    <div class="walkthrough-icon">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M12.22 2h-.44a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v.18a2 2 0 0 1-1 1.73l-.43.25a2 2 0 0 1-2 0l-.15-.08a2 2 0 0 0-2.73.73l-.22.38a2 2 0 0 0 .73 2.73l.15.1a2 2 0 0 1 1 1.72v.51a2 2 0 0 1-1 1.74l-.15.09a2 2 0 0 0-.73 2.73l.22.38a2 2 0 0 0 2.73.73l.15-.08a2 2 0 0 1 2 0l.43.25a2 2 0 0 1 1 1.73V20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h.44a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-.18a2 2 0 0 1 1-1.73l.43-.25a2 2 0 0 1 2 0l.15.08a2 2 0 0 0 2.73-.73l.22-.39a2 2 0 0 0-.73-2.73l-.15-.08a2 2 0 0 1-1-1.74v-.5a2 2 0 0 1 1-1.74l.15-.09a2 2 0 0 0 .73-2.73l-.22-.38a2 2 0 0 0-2.73-.73l-.15.08a2 2 0 0 1-2 0l-.43-.25a2 2 0 0 1-1-1.73V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"/>
        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="flex-1">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#f59e0b]/15 text-[#f59e0b]">STEP 1</span>
        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-[var(--sl-color-white)] m-0">Setup Rubrics &amp; Dynamic Assignment Rules</h4>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--sl-color-gray-2)] m-0 leading-relaxed">
        Administrators define committee units, positions, competency categories, and Likert rating questions. Rule archetypes automatically configure which officers evaluate each other when the cycle activates.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Step 2 -->
  <div class="walkthrough-step">
    <div class="walkthrough-icon">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"/>
        <path d="m9 14 2 2 4-4"/>
        <rect x="8" y="2" width="8" height="4" rx="1" ry="1"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="flex-1">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#293f55]/15 dark:bg-[#7095c0]/20 text-[#293f55] dark:text-[#7095c0]">STEP 2</span>
        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-[var(--sl-color-white)] m-0">Complete Evaluations &amp; Verify Accomplishments</h4>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--sl-color-gray-2)] m-0 leading-relaxed">
        Officers log into their personal task queue, complete ratings with qualitative feedback, and submit their portfolio achievements with verifiable external proof links for admin approval.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Step 3 -->
  <div class="walkthrough-step">
    <div class="walkthrough-icon">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="m12 3-1.912 5.813a2 2 0 0 1-1.275 1.275L3 12l5.813 1.912a2 2 0 0 1 1.275 1.275L12 21l1.912-5.813a2 2 0 0 1 1.275-1.275L21 12l-5.813-1.912a2 2 0 0 1-1.275-1.275L12 3Z"/>
        <path d="M5 3v4"/>
        <path d="M19 17v4"/>
        <path d="M3 5h4"/>
        <path d="M17 19h4"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="flex-1">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#10b981]/15 text-[#10b981]">STEP 3</span>
        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-[var(--sl-color-white)] m-0">Publish Instant Scorecards &amp; Anonymized Growth Insights</h4>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--sl-color-gray-2)] m-0 leading-relaxed">
        Once closed, administrators release the cycle. Members immediately inspect personal radar charts, competency percentiles, and anonymous peer remarks to guide leadership growth.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
